  [
    id 50
    label "85nH0SjTGug"
    step 0
    date "2020-05-11T20:42:17Z"
    title "PLANDEMIC - Who should we trust?"
    description "#BudgetCreator  #Plandemic  #SmallYoutuber&#10;So recently a video entitled Plandemic surfaced on social media platforms. In this video, American ex-research scientist Judy Anne Mikovits made a series of stunning claims which she said will expose the scientific and political elite who run the scam that is our global health system.&#10;The 26 minute video immediately went viral and after just a couple days it had already amassed 1.8 million views and 150,000 shares on Facebook as well as over 4.7 million views on Youtube. Facebook and Youtube have labeled content like this as dangerous misinformation and scrambled to delete these videos but they just kept on popping up. &#10;This led me to ask these questions&#8230; Why is it so difficult for platforms such as Facebook, Youtube and even Twitter to get rid of misinformation and Should these videos be kept on these platforms under the banner of &#8220;Free Speech?&#8221;&#10; &#10;The difficulty in removing these videos&#10; &#10;The first reason why it is so difficult to get rid of misinformation is due to the limitations of automated moderation tools. A perfect example is Facebook filters marking what was deemed to be legitimate Covid-19 news as spam which left many users upset. Due to the increasing need to observe social distancing protocols during this pandemic, companies are now reliant on Artificial Intelligence more than ever.&#10;The second reason is that videos can be shared millions of times before being labelled. Even after being removed, users can simply edit and reupload these videos. By doing this, the algorithm will see this as a new video which will allow it to get even more shares before it is eventually removed again. By then, tens of millions or even hundreds of millions of people could have seen it.&#10;The third reason is labelling videos as content of misinformation simply doesn&#8217;t work. In fact, it does the opposite. Humans are naturally curious creatures and so if you tell someone that this video contains sensitive information, you can bet your last silver coin that they will click on it.&#10; &#10;Why did this video cause such a stir?&#10; &#10;First let us take a look at some of the claims made by Judy Mikovits:&#10;-Judy said wearing a mask could make you sick because it could expose you to your own reactivated coronavirus expressions.&#10;-&#8216;She claims This occurred from SARS 1 within a decade which means it&#8217;s not naturally occurring&#8217;&#10;She also said the following:&#10;-It&#8217;s very clear this virus was manipulated.&#10;-&#8216;If you&#8217;ve ever had a flu vaccine, you were injected with coronaviruses&#8217;&#10;-Hospitals get &#8216;$13,000 from Medicare if you call it COVID-19&#8217; when a patient dies.&#10;-Hydroxychloroquine is &#8216;effective against these families of viruses&#8217;&#10; &#10;Needless to say, all these claims have been debunked by various scientists and doctors as well as PolitiFact. The fear is that people will use dangerous methods to treat covid-19, or ignore public health guidelines for staying safe. &#10;&#10;Thanks so much for viewing. It would mean a lot to me if you could subscribe to my channel. Below are links to my social media accounts:&#10;&#10;https://m.youtube.com/channel/UChfmX6YFxMT7ghImp6S0fFw?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;https://www.instagram.com/glenprincetech?r=nametag&#10;&#10;https://twitter.com/GlenprinceT?s=09 &#10;&#10;Sources:&#10;https://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/2020/05/08/plandemic-judy-mikovits-coronavirus/&#10;&#10;https://www.politifact.com/article/2020/may/08/fact-checking-plandemic-documentary-full-false-con/?fbclid=IwAR0fnMlqncc3udy-lclENDSLiWq-4PTeWczi_9xmmVR9TYWQnwBF8Hi3yFU"
    channeltitle "GlenPrince Tech"
    channelid "UChfmX6YFxMT7ghImp6S0fFw"
