    id 150
    label "sy9djKvqphc"
    step 0
    date "2020-09-07T17:00:31Z"
    title "The Anti-Plandemic Protest - Those who are smeared by the MSM for having a different view to them"
    description "Covid-19 has changed the world we live in.  Some believe it is a real threat to humanity while others do not even think it's a real virus and there are others who think those who released it upon the world are a bigger threat to mankind than the virus itself.   The thing is there are many theories on Covid-19 and there are many in the world who choose not to believe the World Health Organisation or their Government when it comes to how we as a society, country or species should be dealing with this virus.   Anti-Pandemic or Anti-Plandemic protests are taking place all over the world.  I attended the London protest in Trafalgar square - this is some of that day with some of the people there.  I wish to thank all the people there that day who took the time to talk to me before my camera died.  &#10;&#10;Timestamps&#10;00:00 - Intro&#10;00:42 - Monologue on Events&#10;12:34 - David Icke&#10;17:23 - Lady Protesting the Lies of the MSM&#10;21:25 - Immune from fear Protestor &#10;37:01 - No Mandatory Vaccines Protestor &#10;42:58 - Free Julian Assange &#10;54:08 - It's just a Mask.....&#10;&#10;I'm The Wondering Englishman - I spend my days wondering what places are like and what wonders they may have to offer.  My YouTube Channel focuses on Travel content  - taking in the wonders of the world.   Please check out my other content to see who I really am.   I've produced over 300+ video so there is a fair amount of content to check out should you be interested.   So please do click &#9989; Subscribe &#9989;&#10;&#10;&#10;Thank you kindly for watching, commenting, liking and even sharing these videos I try to respond to every comment (good and bad).&#10;&#10;Find me also on:&#10;&#10;&#128038;  My Twitter is: http://www.twitter.com/vanterheyden&#10;&#128248;  My Instagram: http://www.instagram.com/vanterheyden&#10;&#127757; The Wondering Englishman - Website http://www.TheWonderingEnglishman.com&#10;&#127909; The Wondering Englishman on Bitchute - https://www.bitchute.com/channel/21X4VJNf9ANl/&#10;&#127909; The Wondering Englishman on LBRY - https://lbry.tv/@vanTerheyden:f&#10;&#10;&#10;If you would like to support my work in any way you can do so via the following platforms:&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9989;Support me via PledSto for as little as 10 cents a Month https://my.pleds.to/TheWonderingEnglishman&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9989; My SubscribeStar can handle larger donations (It's like Patreon but less Political) https://www.subscribestar.com/the-wondering-englishman&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9989; Or simply buy me a Coffee -  https://ko-fi.com/thewonderingenglishman&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9989; My Paypal - http://www.paypal.me/vanterheyden&#10;&#10;&#10;I'll be sure to mention you in the credits of upcoming videos if you so request.  (Only if you request).   Your support is greatly appreciated! &#10;&#10;&#10;&#127757; When using Taxi's in London -  I recommend Bolt &#38; Uber for your Taxi Needs.  &#10;***Download the Apps from the App Store.***&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9989; Use Code &#34;uberAVT&#34; to get money off your first journey with Uber. &#10;&#9989; Use Code &#34;HFDHF&#34;  to get money off your first journey with Bolt&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#127757; When I&#8217;m travelling I book a lot of my accommodation through Airbnb and Booking . com.&#10;If you would like a free travel credit please help me and help yourself by using the following links - each will give you Free Travel Credit when you sign up Usually between $20-$50 depending on where you are from.&#10;&#9989;  http://www.airbnb.co.uk/c/aterheyden&#10;&#38;&#10;&#9989;  https://www.booking.com/s/34_6/vanter15  - Free Travel Credit&#10;&#10;&#10;To find the cheapest flights anywhere I recommend using Skyscanner &#10;&#9989; Click here to search for flights -  https://bit.ly/Skywonder&#10;&#10;&#10;&#128309; Need a Travel Bag or Backpack for your Travels - I use and recommend the travel bag company RPS Pro Supply - use this affiliate link &#10;&#9989; https://lddy.no/azw0&#10;Use Discount Code - READYPROAF15 - so you get a 15% Discount on first-time purchases.  &#10;&#10;&#10;&#127916;  Video Shot  with: &#10;    &#128309;   Sony Action Cam FDR-X3000   -  https://locally.link/yGCY &#10;    &#128309;   Samsung S20 Ultra -  https://locally.link/IX0y&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;#Covid19 #CoronaVirus #Lockdown #AntiLockdown #Plandemic #Pandemic #London  #Travel #Vlogger #TheWonderingEnglishman"
