    description "If 2020 were a documentary, it would definitely be Plandemic 2, one of the worst documentaries of all time.&#10;&#10;Original video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4Kv58YDfohE&#10;&#10;Judy was never the &#8220;senior&#8221; or corresponding author on an HIV paper: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=judy%20mikovits&#38;sort=date&#38;page=2&#10;&#10;Judy&#8217;s story doesn&#8217;t check out: https://www.sciencemag.org/news/2020/05/fact-checking-judy-mikovits-controversial-virologist-attacking-anthony-fauci-viral&#10;https://science.sciencemag.org/content/334/6063/1636.1&#10;&#10;CDC patented the 2003 SARS virus so that no profits could be made off of technology surrounding it: http://www.nbcnews.com/id/3076748/ns/health-infectious_diseases/t/scientists-race-patent-sars-virus/#.X0llAC2z1p8&#10;&#10;Anthony Fauci is not listed on the SARS 2003 coronavirus patents: https://patentimages.storage.googleapis.com/4d/01/bb/b15d530677fb33/US7776521.pdf&#10;https://patentimages.storage.googleapis.com/6b/c3/21/a62eb55a0e678c/US7220852.pdf&#10;https://patentimages.storage.googleapis.com/a8/c0/6a/0584dd67435ef2/US7279327.pdf&#10;&#10;Research on the SARS 2003 coronavirus was poorly funded: https://www.nbcnews.com/health/health-care/scientists-were-close-coronavirus-vaccine-years-ago-then-money-dried-n1150091&#10;&#10;Natural genes can no longer be patented: https://ghr.nlm.nih.gov/primer/testing/genepatents&#10;&#10;Anthony Fauci&#8217;s patents (none for coronaviruses): https://patents.justia.com/inventor/anthony-s-fauci&#10;&#10;The 2003 SARS virus patent (Anthony Fauci and Ralph Baric are not listed): https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/patent/US7776521#section=Inventor&#10;&#10;COVID-19 related patent information reveals nothing nefarious: https://abg-ip.com/coronavirus-patents/&#10;&#10;1990 paper about recombinant coronaviruses, it didn&#8217;t start with Ralph Baric: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC249107/pdf/jvirol00056-0355.pdf&#10;&#10;The Wuhan Institute of Virology was funded so that they could characterize coronaviruses in China, where the 2003 SARS virus originally came from: https://projectreporter.nih.gov/project_info_description.cfm?aid=9819304&#38;icde=49752569&#10;&#10;The Bayh-Dole act spurred new waves of innovation in the life sciences: https://itif.org/publications/2019/03/04/bayh-dole-acts-vital-importance-us-life-sciences-innovation-system&#10;&#10;The &#8220;A World at Risk&#8221; document: https://apps.who.int/gpmb/assets/annual_report/GPMB_annualreport_2019.pdf&#10;&#10;Who wrote the Event 201 script? Their web site tells you: https://www.centerforhealthsecurity.org/event201/about&#10;&#10;Funding of the World Health Organization: https://www.weforum.org/agenda/2020/04/who-funds-world-health-organization-un-coronavirus-pandemic-covid-trump/&#10;&#10;Criminal charges and jail time can be brought against pharmaceutical companies that violate FDA regulations: https://www.fda.gov/drugs/pharmaceutical-quality-resources/facts-about-current-good-manufacturing-practices-cgmps&#10;&#10;Convicted pharmaceutical executives and associates: &#10;John Kapoor and Insys therapeutics: https://apnews.com/82f638d6dfcf4193ad28ddf0e65897e1&#10;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Kapoor&#10;&#10;Medical errors are not the third leading cause of death: &#10;https://qualitysafety.bmj.com/content/21/9/737.long&#10;https://www.bmj.com/content/351/bmj.h3239&#10;https://qualitysafety.bmj.com/content/26/5/408&#10;https://healthydebate.ca/2019/08/topic/medical-error-causing-death&#10;&#10;Vaccine Injury Compensation data report shows that vaccines are extremely safe: https://www.hrsa.gov/sites/default/files/hrsa/vaccine-compensation/data/data-statistics-report.pdf&#10;&#10;HPV vaccines did not cause death and widespread adverse effects in India: https://www.nature.com/news/calls-in-india-for-legal-action-against-us-charity-1.13700?referral=true&#10;https://www.sciencemag.org/news/2013/09/indian-parliament-comes-down-hard-cervical-cancer-trial&#10;&#10;Polio vaccination in India saved at least 2,611,500 children from paralysis: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3734678/&#10;&#10;Non-polio acute flaccid paralysis in India: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6121585/pdf/ijerph-15-01755.pdf&#10;https://pediatrics.aappublications.org/content/135/Supplement_1/S16.2&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6353074/pdf/pone.0208902.pdf&#10;&#10;Bill Gates wants to stabilize population growth by reducing childhood mortality: https://science.sciencemag.org/content/333/6042/540&#10;&#10;Oxitec&#8217;s genetically modified mosquitoes are meant kill mosquitoes: https://allianceforscience.cornell.edu/blog/2020/06/oxitec-wins-approval-to-release-gmo-mosquitoes-in-us/&#10;&#10;Mosquitoes are not becoming flying vaccines: https://www.sciencemag.org/news/2010/03/researchers-turn-mosquitoes-flying-vaccinators&#10;&#10;The Moderna vaccine is shown to be safe in clinical trials so far: https://www.nejm.org/doi/full/10.1056/NEJMoa2022483&#10;&#10;Song used for outro: Funky Party by Lobo Loco"
